"Lotta Forsberg","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8XVjsJiYvyKqqGjFRrzVeDejlvB.jpg"},{"id":2846457,"name":"Karin Engman","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/muDB86pm1HepcrP8QK3WrZCfk4g.jpg"},{"id":3158602,"name":"Lesley Leichtweis Bernardi","role":"The lady in the train station"},{"id":1794120,"name":"Joacim Landin","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qie3560Lz9e0WyzB5lFdzEdYuDj.jpg"},{"id":2174453,"name":"Conny Block","role":"Sverker Ohlsson"},{"id":3608325,"name":"Erik Igelström","role":"Street Musician"},{"id":3608327,"name":"Pablo Fernandez-Moreno","role":"Man who has killed his daughter"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Sulla infinitezza","overview":"Una riflessione sulla vita umana in tutta la sua bellezza e crudeltà, splendore e banalità. Trasportati in un sogno, siamo guidati dalla gentile voce narrante di una Sherazad. Momenti irrilevanti assumono lo stesso significato degli eventi storici: una coppia fluttua su una Colonia devastata dalla guerra; mentre accompagna la figlia a una festa di compleanno, un padre si ferma per allacciarle le scarpe sotto una pioggia battente; ragazze adolescenti ballano all’esterno di un caffè; un esercito sconfitto marcia verso un campo di prigionia. Ode e lamento al tempo stesso, Om det oändliga è un caleidoscopio di tutto ciò che è eternamente umano, una storia infinita sulla vulnerabilità dell’esistenza."},{"language":"en-US","title":"About Endlessness","overview":"A reflection on human life in all its beauty and cruelty, its splendor and banality, guided by a Scheherazade-esque narrator. Inconsequential moments have the same significance as historical events. Simultaneously an ode and a lament, presents a kaleidoscope of all that is eternally human, an infinite story of the vulnerability of existence."},{"language":"sv-SV","overview":"Guidade av en drömlik kvinnoröst får vi följa med på en resa genom livets stora och små skeenden; ett par svävar över ett krigshärjat Köln, en far stannar för att knyta sin dotters skor i hällregnet och tre tonårsflickor dansar utanför ett kafé; ett kalejdoskop över existensen och oändligheten."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oLbl5varmdPGdH3h3fmU9slAvQc.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sP3TdFwhwLbodffXDfZvybyUdCc.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":348672,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"sv-SV","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oLbl5varmdPGdH3h3fmU9slAvQc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oLbl5varmdPGdH3h3fmU9slAvQc.jpg","language":"it","width":666,"height":1000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oLbl5varmdPGdH3h3fmU9slAvQc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oLbl5varmdPGdH3h3fmU9slAvQc.jpg","language":"it","width":666,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/22Kdl1C6bxPZp4zMvIvv6S7qZyh.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/22Kdl1C6bxPZp4zMvIvv6S7qZyh.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r9Ae28SKaJWHBOpkelsRBQ0kZnH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r9Ae28SKaJWHBOpkelsRBQ0kZnH.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fRIBlFJiMNm7DkphQgcHgDS2Pvx.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fRIBlFJiMNm7DkphQgcHgDS2Pvx.jpg","language":"en","width":1283,"height":1925},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fRIBlFJiMNm7DkphQgcHgDS2Pvx.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fRIBlFJiMNm7DkphQgcHgDS2Pvx.jpg","language":"en","width":1283,"height":1925},{"type":"